/* ---- ffmpeg banner ---- */
"找不到 ffmpeg。請先開啟「終端機」執行:brew install ffmpeg" = "ffmpeg not found. Open Terminal and run: brew install ffmpeg";

/* ---- drop zone ---- */
"把影片檔(.ts / .m2ts / .mkv / .flv / .avi …)或整個資料夾拖進來" = "Drop video files (.ts / .m2ts / .mkv / .flv / .avi …) or whole folders here";
"無損秒轉 MP4:不重編碼、不改解析度,壞檔自動修復" = "Lossless and instant: no re-encoding, no resolution changes, damaged files auto-repaired";

/* ---- options ---- */
"輸出到來源資料夾" = "Output to source folder";
"選擇輸出資料夾…" = "Choose output folder…";
"加入後自動開始" = "Auto start";
"覆蓋已存在的 MP4" = "Overwrite existing MP4s";
"失敗時自動重新編碼" = "Auto re-encode on failure";
