"GPU 硬體加速" = "GPU acceleration";
"重新編碼時使用 Apple VideoToolbox 硬體編碼器:快很多、省電。關閉則用 CPU x264(品質略佳、較慢)" = "Use Apple VideoToolbox when re-encoding: much faster, more power-efficient. Off = CPU x264 (slightly better quality, slower)";

